WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.400
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.670 --> 01:48.009
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.090 --> 01:51.050
[Episode 23]

4
01:57.370 --> 01:58.450
Where is your dad?

5
02:00.940 --> 02:02.140
He went back to Xifu.

6
02:12.470 --> 02:13.280
Fu Shize.

7
02:14.900 --> 02:15.840
Sorry.

8
02:17.180 --> 02:18.710
My dad has a bad temper.

9
02:19.410 --> 02:21.370
His way of thinking is way too conservative.

10
02:21.370 --> 02:23.130
He just wants me to stay in Xifu.

11
02:23.930 --> 02:25.500
He shouldn't have treated you like that.

12
02:25.500 --> 02:26.579
It was too rude.

13
02:33.579 --> 02:34.340
It's okay.

14
02:35.970 --> 02:37.770
You don't need to worry about me.

15
02:39.970 --> 02:41.570
Actually, you didn't have to

16
02:41.910 --> 02:43.710
tell him about your suspension.

17
02:44.250 --> 02:45.980
Others may not understand you,

18
02:46.240 --> 02:47.280
but in my eyes,

19
02:47.280 --> 02:49.520
you are the absolute best.

20
02:49.520 --> 02:50.130
I...

21
02:50.780 --> 02:52.280
I have seen you shine.

22
02:54.480 --> 02:58.140
♪ Dust upon time ♪

23
02:56.090 --> 02:57.360
I hope to see you

24
02:57.360 --> 02:58.530
like that again.

25
02:58.970 --> 03:01.530
♪ Every step soft and slow ♪

26
03:03.340 --> 03:06.520
♪ The room holds my profile ♪

27
03:04.630 --> 03:06.150
Don't you have anything

28
03:06.150 --> 03:07.250
you want to say?

29
03:07.450 --> 03:10.840
♪ Passing no verdict for anyone ♪

30
03:11.090 --> 03:12.630
You want me to go back to XUST

31
03:11.770 --> 03:15.790
♪ Wind brushes the half-drawn curtain ♪

32
03:16.190 --> 03:19.840
♪ Carrying away unneeded words ♪

33
03:16.430 --> 03:18.030
and return to how I used to be.

34
03:19.560 --> 03:20.120
Yeah.

35
03:20.260 --> 03:24.329
♪ Is it true that the more we wish for what we want ♪

36
03:24.350 --> 03:28.590
♪ The more we tend to fall short? ♪

37
03:28.890 --> 03:33.090
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

38
03:33.270 --> 03:36.840
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

39
03:34.060 --> 03:34.860
I understand.

40
03:37.450 --> 03:41.340
♪ Does the fading light ♪

41
03:41.370 --> 03:45.420
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

42
03:46.200 --> 03:50.240
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

43
03:49.590 --> 03:50.400
Fu Shize.

44
03:50.260 --> 03:54.020
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

45
03:51.740 --> 03:52.800
Don't you think

46
03:53.460 --> 03:55.150
there are many problems

47
03:54.700 --> 03:58.520
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

48
03:56.300 --> 03:57.800
with our communication?

49
03:58.550 --> 04:02.960
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

50
04:00.500 --> 04:02.560
There is a lot about your past

51
04:02.740 --> 04:03.590
that you don't want to talk about,

52
04:03.590 --> 04:04.590
and I won't ask you to.

53
04:04.260 --> 04:09.350
♪ Half the tale remains ♪

54
04:11.630 --> 04:13.900
I originally fantasized that

55
04:13.900 --> 04:15.750
if I became your girlfriend,

56
04:16.390 --> 04:17.360
you might one day

57
04:17.360 --> 04:19.430
be willing to tell me on your own.

58
04:24.660 --> 04:25.930
I feel now

59
04:27.240 --> 04:28.130
that it's just

60
04:28.160 --> 04:31.130
my wishful thinking.

61
04:36.130 --> 04:36.800
Look at you.

62
04:36.800 --> 04:37.830
You're doing it right now.

63
04:37.830 --> 04:40.230
Y-You're just staying completely silent.

64
04:40.540 --> 04:41.250
It's the case with

65
04:41.250 --> 04:42.980
that locked room of yours, too.

66
04:43.250 --> 04:44.250
You never explain

67
04:44.250 --> 04:45.540
anything to me.

68
04:49.330 --> 04:51.990
My advisor asked me to go abroad for an exchange.

69
04:52.750 --> 04:53.860
This is indeed

70
04:53.860 --> 04:55.590
a very good opportunity for me.

71
04:56.890 --> 04:58.130
But because this opportunity

72
04:58.130 --> 05:00.240
would take me very far away from you,

73
05:00.500 --> 05:01.660
I chose to stay.

74
05:01.660 --> 05:03.100
I'm willing to stay.

75
05:03.440 --> 05:04.930
How I wish we

76
05:05.530 --> 05:07.230
could be happy together.

77
05:08.630 --> 05:09.430
But you?

78
05:10.430 --> 05:11.600
You just keep your secrets

79
05:11.600 --> 05:12.800
and tell me nothing.

80
05:14.100 --> 05:14.870
Why do you

81
05:14.900 --> 05:16.490
always shut me out?

82
05:18.800 --> 05:20.390
No matter how hard I try,

83
05:20.890 --> 05:22.060
I always feel like I'm looking at you

84
05:22.060 --> 05:23.600
through a layer of fog.

85
05:23.600 --> 05:24.390
I... I can't

86
05:24.390 --> 05:25.920
walk into your heart.

87
05:25.110 --> 05:27.210
♪ Half my clinging stays ♪

88
05:27.240 --> 05:29.010
♪ Half this world ♪

89
05:29.390 --> 05:32.510
♪ Both form something brand-new ♪

90
05:29.860 --> 05:30.660
It's as if

91
05:31.430 --> 05:32.950
my existence

92
05:33.290 --> 05:35.510
♪ You leave your words half-spoken ♪

93
05:33.430 --> 05:34.130
is dispensable

94
05:34.130 --> 05:35.300
to you.

95
05:35.300 --> 05:35.930
I...

96
05:35.850 --> 05:37.760
♪ Another half are lost ♪

97
05:36.190 --> 05:37.860
You don't need me to share

98
05:37.790 --> 05:41.520
♪ Where can I peek for the rest? ♪

99
05:37.860 --> 05:39.790
or participate in your life at all.

100
05:41.870 --> 05:43.870
♪ Half drifting apart ♪

101
05:44.220 --> 05:46.220
♪ Half a hug we share ♪

102
05:46.250 --> 05:49.909
♪ A goodnight too late ♪

103
05:49.990 --> 05:52.190
♪ Let the moon be half-lit ♪

104
05:52.520 --> 05:54.810
♪ Clouds half-hidden too ♪

105
05:56.159 --> 06:03.920
♪ Let me brave once more ♪

106
06:32.650 --> 06:33.659
Why are you so quiet?

107
06:33.659 --> 06:35.260
Are you a ghost, Fu Zhengchu?

108
06:35.740 --> 06:36.460
You've been looking at it for a while.

109
06:36.460 --> 06:37.390
Have some water.

110
06:37.430 --> 06:38.360
I don't want any.

111
06:39.040 --> 06:40.240
Then have some later.

112
06:42.450 --> 06:43.780
What are you looking at?

113
06:47.610 --> 06:48.730
Our professor recommended

114
06:48.730 --> 06:49.960
that I intern at this hotel

115
06:49.960 --> 06:51.490
to study hotel management.

116
06:51.540 --> 06:52.930
It looks very high-end.

117
06:53.130 --> 06:53.720
Is it far?

118
06:55.560 --> 06:57.340
Then, as a family member,

119
06:57.700 --> 06:59.100
do I get a staff discount?

120
06:59.650 --> 07:00.510
It's very far.

121
07:00.800 --> 07:01.770
How far can it be?

122
07:01.950 --> 07:03.310
Hainan? Beijing?

123
07:03.340 --> 07:03.930
It's fine.

124
07:03.930 --> 07:04.840
At worst, I'll fly a few more times

125
07:04.840 --> 07:05.690
to visit you.

126
07:05.920 --> 07:06.480
London.

127
07:08.250 --> 07:09.000
London...

128
07:09.000 --> 07:10.640
That is indeed quite far...

129
07:10.660 --> 07:11.470
London?

130
07:11.930 --> 07:13.130
You're going abroad?

131
07:13.250 --> 07:13.830
Yes.

132
07:14.360 --> 07:16.890
Then wouldn't we be in a long-distance relationship?

133
07:16.890 --> 07:17.930
Is there a problem?

134
07:17.930 --> 07:19.430
Of course there is.

135
07:20.860 --> 07:22.320
Have you decided already?

136
07:22.630 --> 07:24.090
I'm still considering it.

137
07:28.220 --> 07:28.860
Tang Lin,

138
07:29.450 --> 07:30.910
you don't love me anymore.

139
07:33.670 --> 07:35.040
Are you crazy?

140
07:35.540 --> 07:36.740
I'm going abroad for an internship,

141
07:36.740 --> 07:38.140
not breaking up with you.

142
07:38.420 --> 07:39.810
Don't make a fuss.

143
07:40.159 --> 07:41.360
Then I'll go with you.

144
07:41.430 --> 07:42.240
No need.

145
07:42.540 --> 07:43.470
Why would you go?

146
07:43.500 --> 07:44.750
I'm going with Lili.

147
07:44.750 --> 07:46.550
Just be good and wait for me here.

148
08:42.340 --> 08:43.549
Except for the second floor, which I couldn't enter,

149
08:43.549 --> 08:44.290
I wiped

150
08:44.290 --> 08:45.390
everywhere else.

151
08:47.740 --> 08:48.530
I'm sorry.

152
08:48.740 --> 08:50.870
I-I shouldn't have taken the liberty.

153
08:54.720 --> 08:56.430
I'll handle the tidying up

154
08:56.730 --> 08:57.600
from now on.

155
09:01.200 --> 09:04.120
Jiang Zhou?

156
09:05.100 --> 09:06.620
Jiang Yuan?

157
09:07.440 --> 09:09.470
♪ The dusk settles slow ♪

158
09:07.650 --> 09:08.620
I'm sorry, Lili.

159
09:09.500 --> 09:12.510
♪ Too faint of heart to follow through ♪

160
09:11.000 --> 09:11.800
I...

161
09:14.680 --> 09:16.680
♪ It's grown like a habit ♪

162
09:15.150 --> 09:16.700
I'm not ready to talk about it yet.

163
09:16.700 --> 09:19.700
♪ Awaiting dark clouds to spread ♪

164
09:19.670 --> 09:21.270
I'll tell you when I'm ready.

165
09:21.930 --> 09:24.090
♪ Fear promises are shallow ♪

166
09:22.980 --> 09:23.770
Okay?

167
09:25.580 --> 09:27.580
♪ No match for the tides of change ♪

168
09:29.190 --> 09:33.600
♪ Let rain soak all that once was ours ♪

169
09:36.410 --> 09:38.770
♪ Lingering right here ♪

170
09:39.030 --> 09:40.540
♪ Who tries to talk me down? ♪

171
09:40.580 --> 09:42.400
♪ Who makes excuses now? ♪

172
09:42.430 --> 09:45.370
♪ Let memories trail in threads ♪

173
09:46.030 --> 09:49.080
♪ Too shattered to pick up ♪

174
09:50.960 --> 09:54.320
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

175
09:54.530 --> 09:57.560
♪ Willingly I wait ♪

176
09:57.920 --> 10:02.790
♪ To soothe the sorry I said yesterday ♪

177
10:03.380 --> 10:05.350
♪ Half a phrase unspoken ♪

178
10:05.370 --> 10:08.630
♪ Always too late ♪

179
10:08.650 --> 10:11.110
♪ Time freezes still ♪

180
10:11.650 --> 10:14.170
♪ My care burns hot ♪

181
10:14.330 --> 10:17.740
♪ Hidden from your sight ♪

182
10:31.020 --> 10:32.840
♪ A thin short line ♪

183
10:32.860 --> 10:36.480
♪ Two hearts intertwined ♪

184
10:38.210 --> 10:40.210
♪ Which way to go ♪

185
10:40.500 --> 10:43.480
♪ Might be simpler so ♪

186
10:45.510 --> 10:47.270
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

187
10:47.290 --> 10:51.290
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

188
10:52.350 --> 10:57.650
♪ Hesitant feet—which side should I stand on ♪

189
10:59.970 --> 11:02.650
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

190
11:02.670 --> 11:04.260
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

191
11:04.280 --> 11:06.090
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

192
11:06.110 --> 11:09.090
♪ This damp murmur ♪

193
11:09.380 --> 11:13.840
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

194
11:14.490 --> 11:17.840
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

195
11:18.030 --> 11:21.010
♪ Resentment takes root inside ♪

196
11:21.670 --> 11:27.100
♪ Rain falls, and grief runs aground ♪

197
11:27.130 --> 11:28.900
♪ Nothing but remembrance ♪

198
11:29.790 --> 11:32.780
♪ Always too late ♪

199
11:32.800 --> 11:35.040
♪ My regrets are too obvious ♪

200
11:35.210 --> 11:37.610
♪ Drowning the whole world ♪

201
11:37.640 --> 11:42.590
♪ But you always understand ♪

202
12:12.850 --> 12:16.070
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

203
12:16.090 --> 12:19.570
♪ For me to keep my promise ♪

204
12:19.820 --> 12:24.910
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

205
12:25.270 --> 12:27.270
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

206
12:27.300 --> 12:30.470
♪ Maybe someday ♪

207
12:30.490 --> 12:33.330
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

208
12:33.410 --> 12:40.010
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

209
12:40.080 --> 12:50.760
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

210
13:14.580 --> 13:15.440
Where's Yun Li?

211
13:18.010 --> 13:19.220
Did you come alone?

212
13:19.820 --> 13:21.680
I thought she would come with you.

213
13:23.580 --> 13:24.390
Not bad.

214
13:24.870 --> 13:26.110
I didn't expect her to give you

215
13:26.110 --> 13:26.850
break days

216
13:26.870 --> 13:28.470
during the honeymoon phase.

217
13:39.550 --> 13:40.360
What?

218
13:41.220 --> 13:42.150
Had an argument?

219
13:49.120 --> 13:50.580
I really can't imagine it.

220
13:51.010 --> 13:52.250
How did Yun Li manage to have an argument

221
13:52.250 --> 13:53.980
with a man of few words like you?

222
13:55.410 --> 13:56.980
Do you think the old me

223
14:00.860 --> 14:02.520
is better than the current me?

224
14:03.580 --> 14:03.960
What?

225
14:03.990 --> 14:05.750
Why are you asking that in the middle of the night?

226
14:05.750 --> 14:07.340
What old and current you?

227
14:10.320 --> 14:11.910
The old me was better.

228
14:16.050 --> 14:18.910
Is there a difference between the old you

229
14:20.320 --> 14:21.450
and the current you?

230
14:24.180 --> 14:25.320
To me,

231
14:27.150 --> 14:27.790
there is.

232
14:31.000 --> 14:31.950
To her,

233
14:37.390 --> 14:38.200
there is too.

234
14:45.290 --> 14:45.910
Then...

235
14:46.170 --> 14:47.270
What do you think?

236
14:48.460 --> 14:50.060
I feel like I've let her down.

237
14:52.550 --> 14:53.740
The current me

238
14:58.670 --> 15:00.200
is not the person she likes.

239
16:06.240 --> 16:07.170
You're up, Lili.

240
16:08.390 --> 16:09.850
I've prepared breakfast.

241
16:09.860 --> 16:10.670
Come and eat.

242
16:32.310 --> 16:33.360
There's an emergency at home.

243
16:33.360 --> 16:34.560
I'll be away for a bit.

244
17:14.260 --> 17:16.720
Shize, you're awake.

245
17:18.380 --> 17:19.069
Grandma.

246
17:22.569 --> 17:24.369
Grandma, why are you getting up?

247
17:24.730 --> 17:25.420
Are you feeling unwell?

248
17:25.420 --> 17:26.500
I'm fine.

249
17:26.530 --> 17:27.730
I'm all better.

250
17:28.790 --> 17:30.380
I'm going on a trip.

251
17:31.060 --> 17:31.710
Grandma.

252
17:32.740 --> 17:33.880
Where are you going?

253
17:35.600 --> 17:36.890
I'll go with you.

254
17:37.330 --> 17:38.070
No need.

255
17:38.790 --> 17:40.580
Yuan will take me.

256
17:44.140 --> 17:45.100
He said

257
17:45.450 --> 17:46.910
that since spring is here,

258
17:46.980 --> 17:48.580
we can go mountain climbing.

259
17:48.920 --> 17:50.340
When summer comes,

260
17:50.550 --> 17:52.770
I want to see the grasslands.

261
17:53.900 --> 17:56.400
I've never been to the grasslands.

262
17:57.740 --> 17:59.590
Just thinking about it

263
17:59.740 --> 18:00.940
makes me so happy.

264
18:06.220 --> 18:07.880
Then when will you come back?

265
18:09.460 --> 18:10.550
I don't know.

266
18:11.400 --> 18:12.640
If I'm going to visit

267
18:12.980 --> 18:14.630
all these places,

268
18:14.750 --> 18:17.810
I'm afraid it will take a long, long time.

269
18:18.380 --> 18:20.960
I might not come back at all.

270
18:26.230 --> 18:27.970
What if I miss you?

271
18:30.810 --> 18:32.510
Whenever you miss me,

272
18:32.810 --> 18:35.350
I will know.

273
18:37.920 --> 18:38.920
I'll go with you.

274
18:41.310 --> 18:42.660
That won't do.

275
18:43.750 --> 18:45.110
Shize, you're

276
18:45.110 --> 18:46.480
still so young.

277
18:46.970 --> 18:48.500
You need to stay here

278
18:48.850 --> 18:51.380
and find lots and lots of happiness.

279
18:51.970 --> 18:53.060
Only when I see

280
18:53.080 --> 18:54.640
that you are happy,

281
18:54.750 --> 18:56.310
can I rest assured.

282
18:58.750 --> 18:59.550
Grandma.

283
19:03.500 --> 19:05.200
Can you not leave?

284
19:08.180 --> 19:09.510
I can't bear to lose you.

285
19:11.770 --> 19:12.620
Shize.

286
19:14.120 --> 19:15.560
You have to look forward.

287
19:16.770 --> 19:18.920
Don't keep dwelling on the past.

288
19:21.010 --> 19:23.220
As long as you believe it in your heart,

289
19:23.720 --> 19:26.310
your dream will continue.

290
19:27.940 --> 19:31.890
I will become the clouds in the sky,

291
19:32.620 --> 19:35.320
the stars, and the wind,

292
19:35.960 --> 19:38.220
to always be with you.

293
19:39.900 --> 19:41.460
As long as you feel it,

294
19:41.920 --> 19:44.270
I will be there.

295
19:57.020 --> 19:57.870
Shize.

296
19:59.350 --> 20:00.770
I have to go now.

297
20:01.610 --> 20:03.700
Yuan is waiting for me.

298
20:10.330 --> 20:11.300
I'm leaving now.

299
20:13.390 --> 20:14.120
I'm leaving.

300
20:15.850 --> 20:16.640
Grandma.

301
20:19.160 --> 20:20.010
Don't go.

302
20:22.070 --> 20:22.900
Don't go...

303
20:53.380 --> 20:56.250
Grandma, Grandma.

304
20:56.790 --> 20:59.640
Grandma, Grandma.

305
21:02.830 --> 21:03.810
Grandma...

306
21:24.350 --> 21:25.070
Grandma...

307
21:28.460 --> 21:29.590
Have a safe journey.

308
22:01.420 --> 22:04.370
[Tomb of Beloved Son Jiang Yuan]

309
22:38.310 --> 22:38.940
Yuan.

310
22:46.530 --> 22:47.830
Grandma is gone.

311
22:53.740 --> 22:55.670
Now I only have Lili left.

312
22:58.950 --> 22:59.790
I think...

313
23:00.630 --> 23:03.800
You're different from how you used to be.

314
23:04.310 --> 23:05.110
I just think

315
23:05.110 --> 23:07.250
the old you, who was so confident

316
23:07.770 --> 23:09.050
and radiant,

317
23:09.220 --> 23:10.460
looked really great.

318
23:11.920 --> 23:13.500
I've seen you shine.

319
23:16.980 --> 23:18.270
I hope to see you

320
23:18.270 --> 23:19.380
like that again.

321
23:24.770 --> 23:26.160
But what she likes

322
23:28.070 --> 23:28.960
and wants

323
23:34.110 --> 23:35.680
is the me from 7 years ago.

324
23:43.270 --> 23:43.810
Yuan.

325
23:48.000 --> 23:49.250
I don't dare tell her

326
23:51.410 --> 23:52.540
that Fu Shize

327
23:56.900 --> 23:58.070
is already gone.

328
24:05.330 --> 24:06.740
I can never go back.

329
24:42.730 --> 24:45.520
[Sip Slow Stay Lazy Homestay]

330
24:54.770 --> 24:56.640
Look at how listless you are.

331
24:56.740 --> 24:58.940
He must've not replied to your message.

332
25:02.240 --> 25:03.140
No matter how busy he is with work,

333
25:03.140 --> 25:04.030
he should at least have time

334
25:04.030 --> 25:05.230
to reply to a message.

335
25:05.360 --> 25:06.160
Besides,

336
25:06.190 --> 25:07.170
isn't it normal

337
25:07.190 --> 25:08.800
to argue when you're dating?

338
25:08.860 --> 25:10.300
He stops replying after a little argument...

339
25:10.300 --> 25:12.430
Isn't that just the silent treatment?

340
25:14.010 --> 25:15.010
What do you think?

341
25:18.940 --> 25:22.000
Are you going to keep waiting for him to come back to you?

342
25:26.070 --> 25:29.330
I'll just treat it as us giving each other

343
25:29.330 --> 25:31.350
some space.

344
25:35.140 --> 25:38.070
Perhaps this kind of halftime break

345
25:38.740 --> 25:41.240
can make us stop

346
25:41.400 --> 25:42.880
and think things through.

347
25:45.700 --> 25:46.570
Didn't your advisor previously

348
25:46.570 --> 25:48.270
recommend that you study abroad?

349
25:48.270 --> 25:49.600
Have you considered it?

350
25:51.030 --> 25:51.900
I haven't

351
25:51.900 --> 25:53.760
seriously considered it before.

352
25:55.070 --> 25:56.090
The teachers in our department

353
25:56.090 --> 25:57.090
also want me to go

354
25:57.140 --> 25:58.750
to a hotel in the UK for an internship.

355
25:58.750 --> 26:00.100
If you also go to the UK,

356
26:00.130 --> 26:01.860
we can keep each other company.

357
26:03.140 --> 26:04.570
Let me think about it.

358
26:06.290 --> 26:07.530
When you feel better,

359
26:07.530 --> 26:08.940
give it some serious thought.

360
26:08.940 --> 26:10.340
It's a rare opportunity.

361
26:18.820 --> 26:19.640
Hello, Mom.

362
26:19.670 --> 26:20.200
Lili,

363
26:20.200 --> 26:21.400
y-your brother started having a fever

364
26:21.400 --> 26:22.070
last night.

365
26:22.070 --> 26:23.200
It's 39 degrees now.

366
26:23.290 --> 26:24.240
He's already starting

367
26:24.240 --> 26:25.140
to talk nonsense because of his fever.

368
26:25.140 --> 26:26.380
What should we do?

369
26:26.530 --> 26:28.930
He needs to go to the hospital for an IV drip.

370
26:28.960 --> 26:29.810
I have to go.

371
26:30.250 --> 26:31.200
Your dad is back.

372
26:31.220 --> 26:32.220
We're taking your brother

373
26:32.220 --> 26:33.350
to the hospital now.

374
26:34.480 --> 26:35.530
Mom, don't worry.

375
26:35.530 --> 26:36.180
If anything happens,

376
26:36.180 --> 26:37.580
let me know immediately.

377
26:37.890 --> 26:38.670
Got it.

378
26:38.690 --> 26:39.840
I'll hang up now.

379
26:43.200 --> 26:44.030
Don't worry.

380
26:44.070 --> 26:44.940
He'll be fine.

381
27:31.680 --> 27:32.940
Your brother is hospitalized.

382
27:32.940 --> 27:34.140
Come back right away.

383
27:38.910 --> 27:39.670
[Flight Ticket Schedule]

384
27:59.350 --> 28:00.550
Fu Shize.

385
28:02.050 --> 28:04.250
Why aren't you replying to my messages?

386
28:22.180 --> 28:23.360
Yun Ye is sick.

387
28:23.880 --> 28:25.480
I'm heading back to Xifu now.

388
28:51.030 --> 28:52.830
Can you come and keep me company?

389
29:46.180 --> 29:46.680
Dad.

390
29:47.250 --> 29:47.700
Dad.

391
29:47.770 --> 29:48.840
How is Yun Ye?

392
29:50.130 --> 29:51.200
He's inside.

393
29:51.220 --> 29:51.980
This way.

394
30:00.000 --> 30:02.090
I just signed a critical condition notice.

395
30:02.090 --> 30:03.270
The doctor said it's cholecystitis

396
30:03.270 --> 30:04.800
that turned into acute pancreatitis.

397
30:04.800 --> 30:06.780
They are determining the surgical plan now.

398
30:06.780 --> 30:07.610
Once the plan is set,

399
30:07.610 --> 30:09.810
they'll arrange an emergency surgery.

400
30:16.900 --> 30:17.770
The hospital only allows one person

401
30:17.770 --> 30:19.200
to go in and accompany him.

402
30:19.200 --> 30:21.350
How did that suddenly happen to him?

403
30:33.380 --> 30:35.590
[Emergency]

404
30:44.600 --> 30:46.190
Shize, you're awake.

405
30:47.700 --> 30:48.290
What are you doing?

406
30:48.290 --> 30:48.680
Don't move.

407
30:48.680 --> 30:49.000
Don't move.

408
30:49.000 --> 30:50.000
You're on an IV.

409
30:57.610 --> 30:58.140
Mom.

410
31:00.020 --> 31:00.940
What happened to me?

411
31:00.940 --> 31:02.540
You have a perforated ulcer.

412
31:03.400 --> 31:05.460
I really don't know what to say to you.

413
31:06.080 --> 31:07.170
But it's okay.

414
31:07.200 --> 31:09.200
We've arranged everything for you.

415
31:10.720 --> 31:11.480
What do you want to do?

416
31:11.480 --> 31:11.740
What are you doing?

417
31:11.740 --> 31:12.090
Don't move.

418
31:12.090 --> 31:12.960
Tell me, what do you want to do?

419
31:12.960 --> 31:13.570
Tell us.

420
31:14.680 --> 31:15.680
Where's my phone?

421
31:16.080 --> 31:17.480
Okay, I'll get it for you.

422
31:22.240 --> 31:22.980
Be careful.

423
31:32.240 --> 31:33.510
What are you doing? Don't sit up.

424
31:33.510 --> 31:33.940
What are you doing?

425
31:33.940 --> 31:35.180
What are you doing, my son?

426
31:35.180 --> 31:36.580
You're on an IV right now.

427
31:36.770 --> 31:37.740
What are you doing, Shize?

428
31:37.740 --> 31:38.810
Where are you going?

429
31:38.810 --> 31:39.700
Dad, Mom.

430
31:40.690 --> 31:41.570
I have an emergency.

431
31:41.570 --> 31:42.740
The surgery can wait a couple of days.

432
31:42.740 --> 31:43.980
No matter how urgent it is,

433
31:43.980 --> 31:45.640
wait until after the surgery this afternoon.

434
31:45.640 --> 31:47.180
Do you have a death wish?

435
31:47.400 --> 31:47.830
Get up quickly.

436
31:47.830 --> 31:48.530
Go call the doctor.

437
31:48.530 --> 31:49.000
Okay.

438
31:49.000 --> 31:50.480
Son, Son!

439
31:50.910 --> 31:52.060
Are you okay?

440
31:52.090 --> 31:52.790
Son.

441
32:04.000 --> 32:05.770
Son, hang in there.

442
32:20.090 --> 32:21.350
You have hemorrhoids?

443
32:24.590 --> 32:25.400
It's fine.

444
32:25.400 --> 32:26.680
Kids your age

445
32:26.680 --> 32:27.530
sit on chairs all day

446
32:27.530 --> 32:28.570
and all night.

447
32:28.900 --> 32:31.030
It's normal to get these minor issues.

448
32:31.740 --> 32:33.330
Going to bed so early today?

449
32:33.330 --> 32:35.190
Why are you pretending to be good?

450
32:35.850 --> 32:36.960
My stomach hurts.

451
32:37.840 --> 32:38.700
I made some braised pork.

452
32:38.700 --> 32:39.630
It's in the fridge.

453
32:39.630 --> 32:41.500
If you're hungry, take it out and eat it.

454
32:41.500 --> 32:42.290
I'll pass.

455
32:42.400 --> 32:44.500
I felt nauseous after eating it last time.

456
32:44.500 --> 32:46.030
Something just felt wrong.

457
32:51.420 --> 32:53.700
Yun Ye told me long ago

458
32:53.940 --> 32:56.000
that his stomach was uncomfortable.

459
32:58.710 --> 33:01.570
As his sister, I didn't even notice anything wrong.

460
33:02.810 --> 33:04.470
I'm a terrible sister.

461
33:11.720 --> 33:13.530
[Operating Room]

462
33:21.090 --> 33:21.890
Well...

463
33:22.180 --> 33:23.950
You should go home and rest first.

464
33:23.950 --> 33:25.440
Come back tomorrow after the surgery.

465
33:25.440 --> 33:26.000
Dad.

466
33:26.680 --> 33:27.680
You go back first.

467
33:28.230 --> 33:28.660
No.

468
33:28.830 --> 33:29.790
You're old.

469
33:29.790 --> 33:30.900
You can't handle staying up.

470
33:30.900 --> 33:32.030
Come, give me the stuff.

471
33:32.030 --> 33:33.530
I'll call you if anything happens.

472
33:33.530 --> 33:34.130
Off you go.

473
33:36.290 --> 33:37.010
Remember to call me.

474
33:37.010 --> 33:37.900
Sleep well.

475
33:56.710 --> 34:00.540
[Death rate of cholecystitis-induced acute pancreatitis]

476
34:42.730 --> 34:44.320
Where did you go?

477
34:47.139 --> 34:48.850
When I need you the most,

478
34:49.900 --> 34:51.130
I can't even find you.

479
34:52.070 --> 34:52.880
Lili.

480
34:54.380 --> 34:55.170
Tangy.

481
34:57.510 --> 34:58.280
How is Yun Ye?

482
34:58.310 --> 34:59.270
Why are you here?

483
34:59.500 --> 35:01.010
I heard Yun Ye is having surgery,

484
35:01.010 --> 35:02.000
so I rushed over.

485
35:02.100 --> 35:02.880
Thank you.

486
35:04.070 --> 35:05.800
Why are you thanking me?

487
35:06.000 --> 35:07.400
How is the situation now?

488
35:08.480 --> 35:10.880
He was issued a critical condition notice.

489
35:10.980 --> 35:12.000
That serious?

490
35:13.010 --> 35:14.900
But the surgery is already scheduled

491
35:14.900 --> 35:16.360
and his vitals are stable.

492
35:16.730 --> 35:17.650
He'll be fine.

493
35:21.260 --> 35:22.260
Where is Fu Shize?

494
35:24.530 --> 35:26.930
I... I haven't been able to contact him yet.

495
35:27.500 --> 35:28.170
What's the point

496
35:28.170 --> 35:29.190
of having a boyfriend like this?

497
35:29.190 --> 35:30.190
When you need him the most,

498
35:30.190 --> 35:30.940
he's nowhere to be found.

499
35:30.940 --> 35:31.880
Is he going to wait until the problem is solved

500
35:31.880 --> 35:32.940
before showing up?

501
35:34.710 --> 35:35.460
This won't do.

502
35:35.460 --> 35:36.360
I want to see

503
35:36.400 --> 35:38.190
what exactly he's busy with.

504
35:38.280 --> 35:39.480
I've already called.

505
35:39.880 --> 35:40.810
No one answered.

506
35:45.630 --> 35:46.630
Break up with him.

507
35:48.780 --> 35:50.300
When Yun Ye gets better, break up with him.

508
35:50.300 --> 35:51.090
Then we'll go abroad

509
35:51.090 --> 35:52.220
and leave this jerk.

510
35:53.780 --> 35:54.710
Tangy.

511
35:55.190 --> 35:57.360
Don't say that.

512
35:58.610 --> 36:00.190
I'm just so mad.

513
36:02.670 --> 36:04.130
You haven't eaten, right?

514
36:04.400 --> 36:05.800
I'll go buy you some food.

515
36:16.300 --> 36:17.090
Thank you.

516
36:21.880 --> 36:23.480
Tang Lin, where did you go?

517
36:23.530 --> 36:24.730
Keep your voice down.

518
36:26.260 --> 36:27.170
I've been calling you all day,

519
36:27.170 --> 36:27.690
and you didn't answer.

520
36:27.690 --> 36:29.040
Where exactly did you go?

521
36:29.040 --> 36:30.640
I'm answering now, aren't I?

522
36:30.880 --> 36:32.070
I was on a plane earlier,

523
36:32.070 --> 36:32.730
so I couldn't answer.

524
36:32.730 --> 36:33.500
Plane?

525
36:35.500 --> 36:36.500
Did you go abroad?

526
36:36.980 --> 36:37.940
Did you just sneak out

527
36:37.940 --> 36:39.340
without even discussing it with me?

528
36:39.340 --> 36:40.740
What are you yelling for?

529
36:41.000 --> 36:42.460
Even if I didn't go abroad today,

530
36:42.460 --> 36:44.420
I'll go abroad in the future anyway.

531
36:44.420 --> 36:46.020
It has already been decided.

532
36:46.760 --> 36:48.600
And you didn't even discuss it with me?

533
36:48.600 --> 36:49.780
Aren't I your boyfriend?

534
36:49.780 --> 36:51.510
So what if you're my boyfriend?

535
36:51.800 --> 36:52.500
You men

536
36:52.500 --> 36:53.460
are all the same.

537
36:54.170 --> 36:56.030
No matter what our relationship is,

538
36:56.030 --> 36:57.570
I have to be myself first.

539
36:57.940 --> 36:58.730
It's my own choice.

540
36:58.730 --> 36:59.340
Why do I need to ask

541
36:59.340 --> 37:00.540
for your permission?

542
37:01.030 --> 37:01.500
I'm worried about

543
37:01.500 --> 37:03.300
your safety after you go abroad.

544
37:03.570 --> 37:05.170
What's there to worry about?

545
37:05.170 --> 37:06.400
Lili will be with me.

546
37:08.780 --> 37:09.350
Then,

547
37:10.610 --> 37:11.410
what about me?

548
37:17.780 --> 37:18.880
How would I know?

549
37:19.730 --> 37:20.190
I can only

550
37:20.190 --> 37:21.920
be responsible for my own life.

551
37:24.010 --> 37:24.550
Tang Lin.

552
37:24.960 --> 37:25.340
I know

553
37:25.340 --> 37:26.510
you haven't gone abroad yet.

554
37:26.510 --> 37:27.310
Where are you?

555
37:27.690 --> 37:28.750
I'll come find you.

556
37:29.570 --> 37:30.440
Don't come.

557
37:30.480 --> 37:31.940
I don't have time to see you right now.

558
37:31.940 --> 37:32.800
I'm hanging up.

559
37:44.680 --> 37:45.210
Oh my god,

560
37:45.580 --> 37:47.010
where did my handsome younger brother

561
37:47.010 --> 37:47.930
go?

562
37:49.300 --> 37:50.800
Look at your face,

563
37:50.800 --> 37:52.190
it's frowning like a bulldog.

564
37:52.190 --> 37:53.280
So ugly.

565
37:56.130 --> 37:56.840
Congsheng,

566
37:57.090 --> 37:58.290
stop making fun of me.

567
38:00.570 --> 38:01.900
What exactly happened?

568
38:05.190 --> 38:06.780
I'm heartbroken.

569
38:07.840 --> 38:09.280
What's the situation?

570
38:13.010 --> 38:14.150
Tangy and Lili

571
38:14.170 --> 38:15.600
are going abroad together.

572
38:15.600 --> 38:16.540
They didn't even discuss it with me

573
38:16.540 --> 38:18.140
before making the decision.

574
38:18.440 --> 38:19.640
I've been abandoned.

575
38:19.840 --> 38:20.570
Is it because

576
38:20.570 --> 38:22.200
you guys have been arguing lately,

577
38:22.200 --> 38:23.210
and she's just saying that

578
38:23.210 --> 38:24.520
out of anger?

579
38:26.480 --> 38:27.810
She's serious about it.

580
38:30.340 --> 38:31.880
You've only been together for a few days,

581
38:31.880 --> 38:33.070
and now it's a long-distance relationship.

582
38:33.070 --> 38:34.500
That's really tough.

583
38:35.980 --> 38:37.900
Is there no room for negotiation?

584
38:40.560 --> 38:41.350
No.

585
38:41.860 --> 38:43.320
Her attitude is very firm.

586
38:47.730 --> 38:50.190
Why don't you call Uncle and ask?

587
38:50.440 --> 38:52.700
Didn't they say Lili is going abroad too?

588
38:53.880 --> 38:54.480
Right.

589
39:01.990 --> 39:03.560
[Fu Zhengchu]

590
39:13.780 --> 39:14.280
Hello.

591
39:16.880 --> 39:17.690
Qingsong?

592
39:18.340 --> 39:19.200
Where's Uncle?

593
39:19.800 --> 39:21.130
What do you need him for?

594
39:21.940 --> 39:23.250
Tang Lin and Lili

595
39:23.280 --> 39:24.670
are going to study in the UK together.

596
39:24.670 --> 39:25.690
I want to ask Uncle

597
39:25.690 --> 39:27.440
if he knows what's going on.

598
39:30.510 --> 39:32.930
[No.1 Hospital of Xifu City]

599
39:37.190 --> 39:38.000
Hello.

600
39:38.090 --> 39:38.800
These are Yun Ye's

601
39:38.800 --> 39:39.980
pre-op test results.

602
39:39.980 --> 39:41.380
The blood test report isn't out yet.

603
39:41.380 --> 39:41.750
Okay,

604
39:41.780 --> 39:42.400
when it's out later,

605
39:42.400 --> 39:43.570
bring it to me.

606
39:43.570 --> 39:44.300
Okay.

607
39:57.300 --> 39:58.380
Hello, Senior.

608
39:59.000 --> 39:59.590
Li,

609
39:59.590 --> 40:01.300
is there any news about Yun Ye lately?

610
40:01.300 --> 40:02.090
He used to send me

611
40:02.090 --> 40:02.880
a text message every day.

612
40:02.880 --> 40:04.170
He hasn't sent any recently,

613
40:04.170 --> 40:05.770
and I can't reach him either.

614
40:08.980 --> 40:10.500
Li, can you tell me?

615
40:10.500 --> 40:11.170
We agreed

616
40:11.170 --> 40:12.980
to meet up during the summer vacation.

617
40:12.980 --> 40:14.630
Did something happen to him?

618
40:17.670 --> 40:19.480
Yun Ye is sick.

619
40:20.530 --> 40:21.340
It's

620
40:22.370 --> 40:25.370
cholecystitis that turned into acute pancreatitis.

621
40:29.510 --> 40:30.840
What happened to Yun Ye?

622
40:33.050 --> 40:34.090
Yun Ye is sick.

623
40:37.620 --> 40:38.380
Great-uncle.

624
40:38.380 --> 40:39.710
You're here, Qingsong.

625
40:40.510 --> 40:42.110
How is it? Is he doing better?

626
40:42.800 --> 40:43.590
A bit better.

627
40:45.720 --> 40:47.200
Why don't you go back and rest?

628
40:47.200 --> 40:48.200
I can stay here.

629
40:50.980 --> 40:51.780
That works.

630
40:52.100 --> 40:53.360
Call me if anything happens.

631
40:53.360 --> 40:54.420
Okay, don't worry.

632
40:56.730 --> 40:57.630
Take good care of him.

633
40:57.630 --> 40:58.320
Take care.

634
41:12.260 --> 41:14.550
[Operating Room]

635
41:26.340 --> 41:27.070
Li.

636
41:28.150 --> 41:29.440
How is Yun Ye?

637
41:30.940 --> 41:32.400
He's in surgery.

638
41:40.030 --> 41:41.190
Keep Yunyi company.

639
41:41.190 --> 41:41.920
I'm fine.

640
42:10.670 --> 42:11.480
You're awake.

641
42:12.670 --> 42:13.820
How do you feel?

642
42:14.110 --> 42:15.440
Are you feeling better?

643
42:22.130 --> 42:23.130
Don't move.

644
42:23.400 --> 42:24.400
Where's my phone?

645
42:25.090 --> 42:26.230
Give me my phone.

646
42:27.340 --> 42:28.820
Here it is.

647
42:30.460 --> 42:31.280
Take it easy.

648
42:51.940 --> 42:52.530
Lili.

649
42:52.960 --> 42:54.710
I still have some things to do here.

650
42:54.710 --> 42:56.240
I'll go see you in a few days.

651
43:02.130 --> 43:03.720
Texting Yun Li again...

652
43:07.590 --> 43:08.280
Does she know

653
43:08.280 --> 43:09.500
about your surgery?

654
43:10.400 --> 43:11.190
No.

655
43:11.690 --> 43:12.840
Surgery is a big deal.

656
43:12.840 --> 43:14.230
Why didn't you tell her?

657
43:17.480 --> 43:19.000
I don't want her to worry.

658
43:21.880 --> 43:22.590
Shize.

659
43:23.390 --> 43:24.140
Some things

660
43:24.160 --> 43:25.640
just have to be said.

661
43:26.530 --> 43:27.100
I don't know

662
43:27.100 --> 43:28.660
what happened between you two.

663
43:28.660 --> 43:29.930
But Zhengchu told me

664
43:30.480 --> 43:32.510
that Yun Li is going to the UK.

665
43:38.670 --> 43:39.480
What?

666
43:40.780 --> 43:41.710
You didn't know?

667
43:45.280 --> 43:46.070
Shize.

668
43:46.910 --> 43:48.470
You changed so much for her,

669
43:49.090 --> 43:50.620
but now she's going abroad.

670
43:50.950 --> 43:52.610
Do you think it's all worth it?

671
44:03.900 --> 44:04.690
You...

672
44:09.020 --> 44:09.730
Don't move.

673
44:28.800 --> 44:29.900
Don't worry.

674
44:30.530 --> 44:31.590
The surgery went well.

675
44:31.590 --> 44:32.820
He'll recover soon.

676
44:37.840 --> 44:39.000
Get some rest.

677
44:39.480 --> 44:41.410
I'll go stay with Yunyi for a while.

678
44:42.030 --> 44:43.000
Thank you, Senior.
